Z||000010||Monkeyman||04-10-2000||09:11 PM||||I used to drive 15 miles to work (each way).  I did it a few times in blowing and drifting snow (out in the country).  Mismatched tires, less than 100% steering, etc.  I never had any problems.||||reg||1
